WEBVTT

00:03:28.396 --> 00:03:30.770
on the Maersk Kendal,

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.112
a mid-sized container ship

00:03:32.112 --> 00:03:35.340
carrying nearly 7,000 boxes,

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.237
and I departed from Felixstowe,

00:03:37.237 --> 00:03:39.000
on the south coast of England,

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.161
and I ended up right here in Singapore

00:03:41.161 --> 00:03:42.654
five weeks later,

00:03:42.654 --> 00:03:47.558
considerably less jet-lagged than I am right now.

00:03:47.558 --> 00:03:50.800
And it was a revelation.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.995
We traveled through five seas,

00:03:52.995 --> 00:03:55.542
two oceans, nine ports,

00:03:55.542 --> 00:03:58.289
and I learned a lot about shipping.

00:03:58.289 --> 00:04:00.007
And one of the first things that surprised me